cpal — Cross-Platform Audio Library, pure Rust. Used by Speedwave (Desktop,
meeting-transcription feature) on Windows only, for WASAPI loopback capture.
Linked statically into the Windows build of the desktop app.

Upstream: https://github.com/RustAudio/cpal
